OL,3,GNEWSACounty's first medical school
OL,4,Awelcomes students
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first medical school in a county
OL,7,Fhas welcomed its inaugural students
OL,8,Fundertaking a five-year bachelor
OL,9,Fdegree.
OL,11,FThe University of Hertfordshire's
OL,12,Fmedical school, in Hatfield, said it
OL,13,Faimed to recruit up to 70 international
OL,14,Fstudents a year.
OL,16,FStudents from the university's first
OL,17,Fintake have travelled from countries
OL,18,Fincluding Australia, Canada, the US,
OL,19,Fthe United Arab Emirates and Zimbabwe.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
