OL,3,GNEWSACounty's first medical school
OL,4,Awelcomes students
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of them, Vanessa Milne, 56, who is
OL,7,Ffrom New Zealand, said: "It's taken a
OL,8,Flot of courage to come here but the
OL,9,Fstaff have been amazing and have made
OL,10,Fme feel welcome."
